{
 "_doc": "Tier-2 Ashen watch camp at the treeline on the rise north of Route 9 (region D6), where the Bloom's deep larch wood ends. Mostly outdoors: a palisade of prop sections (2 m and 1 m) round a compound of yard cells, with three small kit rooms dressed by shell props (out_longhouse_shell, out_smoke_hut_shell, out_lean_to_shell: bark, pole and sod walls and roofs, lined inside, openings where the plan's doors are; style roof 'none') and a cache pit cut into the ground under the longhouse. The validator treats the yard as open: the palisade, the barred gate and the 1 m burnt breach are real only in game (prop collision). Route: the trail -> the barred gate -> round the palisade -> the breach with the bone chimes (alarm: wakes the camp) -> the burial platform for the cache key (taking it, or the jaws in the grass, wakes the watchers in the lean-to) -> the longhouse through its clawed east wall (entering wakes the sick) -> the hatch to the cache pit (the keeper guards the cache) -> the longhouse's bolted back door out through the palisade line. Sleepers are Ashen Hollowed (enemy ashen_hollow). See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
